# Workflow: Design AI Experience

## 1. Identify the AI surface
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `.ai/project_profile.yaml`
- Pick the exact AI feature or flow being reviewed
- Confirm the expected user outcome

## 2. Review the prompt and output shape
- Check whether the prompt asks for useful, specific behavior
- Verify the response format fits the UI that renders it
- Look for brittle parsing or over-reliance on model wording

## 3. Review trust and fallback behavior
- Make fallback states easy to understand
- Ensure failures do not leave the user blocked or confused
- Avoid collecting more personal data than the feature needs

## 4. Review the product voice
- Keep the AI tone consistent with the rest of the app
- Favor calm, premium, helpful language over hype
- Make output feel specific and grounded

## 5. Report
- Summarize what is working well
- Flag reliability, clarity, and safety concerns separately
